WEBVTT

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:42.740
Pretty stars, huh?

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:43.740
Uh-huh.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:48.410
Tim, someday, someone from another planet is going to be coming for you.

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:49.750
Coming for me?

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:50.720
That's right.

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:55.420
Somewhere up in that starry sky, there's someone who thinks very much of you.

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:59.860
But don't forget, Tim, that you're...

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:10.440
This is Mister Timothy Constance, 13 years old.

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:13.440
He hails from Planet Primavera. His mother...

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:19.440
...was Marianne Constance, and his father was Albert Rosenfelt.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:21.710
Albert Rosenfelt?

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:25.780
The head of the Rosenfelt Financial Group, who recently passed away, right?

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:28.120
Rosenfelt Financial Group?

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.790
They're a giant capital market,

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:34.060
in control of 6.82°% of the financial capital in the galaxy.

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:38.000
According to the latest statistics, it's 7.14°% .

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:41.060
Well, you're an uptown boy, then!

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:46.100
Mister Timothy Constance was named in Mr. Albert's will

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.410
to succeed him as the next head of the financial group.

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:51.340
That is, if he can confirm who he is at the designated location,

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:55.410
by the time and date specified in the provisions of the will.

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:56.950
By standard time,

00:02:56.950 --> 00:03:00.420
there are still 36 hours, 13 minutes and 59 seconds remaining.

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:02.420
If he is unable to confirm who he is?

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:05.090
Then any talk of inheritance will be lost.

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:08.090
Wow, that would be a shame!

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:10.960
Afterward, there would likely be a scramble

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.100
for all the business and concessions by everyone involved.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.430
Ordinarily, we would send notice to the designated location,

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:18.570
but the information file has been damaged,

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:21.110
and the location cannot be determined.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:23.780
They've made it look as though there has been some outside interference,

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:26.340
but the financial group's administrative office

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:28.110
appears to be maneuvering something behind the scenes.

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:34.050
Your duty is to use the restored data to find the designated planet,

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:37.060
and deliver Mister Constance there before the deadline is up.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:40.060
This is the only document we have to go on for clues, huh?

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:45.730
"DNA analysis will be held on the planet where Albert Rosenfelt was born."

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:47.730
Lumiere, how about it?

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:50.340
I'm still looking it up on the network.

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:53.400
Searching for personal information is difficult.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.740
Well, it's probably not going to be easy.

00:03:56.740 --> 00:04:02.080
All the more so for people who have become so upper-class.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:04.750
You don't have to be so nervous.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.550
Mister Constance,

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:10.760
we're going to make sure that your right to succession is observed.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:15.760
Please stop calling me "Mister." It doesn't feel like my name, after all.

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:17.760
I found it.

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:20.100
The Boldor system...

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.770
Planet Farandole.

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:25.100
That's on the other side of the galaxy, huh?

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.730
It's just a moment away once we warp!

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:44.390
A poor boy is magically transformed into a wealthy person, huh?

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:49.380
Oh, it's so romantic! It's like in that book I just read. Right?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:57.560
Well, let's go. If we lose sight of them, we're going to get scolded, you know?

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:03.740
They eloped!?

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:08.150
In order for my dad to marry my mom, he gave up his right to succession,

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:11.420
and temporarily left the Rosenfelt Financial Group.

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:16.090
And so, on Planet Primavera, he undertook farming, right?

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:21.090
At the time, I understand my dad went by his real name, Clifford.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:24.900
But in the end, my dad deserted me and my mom,

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:29.100
and succeeded to the name of the head of the family, Albert.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:32.100
I don't even know my dad's face.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:36.370
I didn't know I was related to the Rosenfelt family.

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:41.010
After my mom passed away, I worked on my uncle's farm.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:45.380
That's where I was recently contacted by GOTT,

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:49.390
and I first heard about everything from my uncle.

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:52.560
Even so, what a selfish father you had, huh?

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:54.390
Neglecting you for all that time,

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.730
and then, when the time comes, wanting for you to follow after him?

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:57.730
Now, hold on!

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:01.400
On top of that, what with GOTT and the financial group's administrative office,

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:04.070
you're getting twisted around according to the expectations of adults...

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:06.590
No, it's not like that...

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:31.360
We've got the wrong place, huh?

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:34.420
We can't be... the references definitely said it was here.

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:39.370
Are you sure this is really the planet your father was born on?

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.710
No, I don't know anything about my dad except for his name...

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:45.730
His name! There might be a chance that...

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:52.380
My dad didn't have the name Albert until after he left me and my mom.

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:56.390
To me, Albert is not my dad. He's a different person.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.720
There it is.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:01.060
The Sylvia system, Planet Sylvana?

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:04.060
His father was the 25th head of the group.

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.700
That was the planet where he succeeded to the name Albert,

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:09.130
and was recognized as the heir to the financial group.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:13.400
There are two standard hours left.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:14.890
We're just in time, huh?

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:20.410
Meteor storm approaching. Crash course!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.750
What an amazing coincidence.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.080
You mean, someone caused this?

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.080
Yes, it's probably a warning.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:28.480
If we go around, we won't make it in time!

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:37.360
Are you okay?

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:38.660
Are you scared?

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:42.370
That's the way boys should be!

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:43.430
Éclair!

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:45.700
Evade!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:46.830
We won't make it!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.370
W- what was that just now?

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:00.390
Hi!!

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:03.050
Viola! <i>Cesario-san!</i>

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:06.720
<i>Lumi-chan, Éc-chan,</i> haven't seen you in a while!

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:09.060
Stop calling me that!

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:11.400
<i>Éc-chan,</i> you are <i>Éc-chan,</i> right?

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:12.400
Ah, do whatever you want!

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:14.400
- Who are those people? - And <i>Lumi-chan</i> is <i>Lumi-chan!</i>

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.730
- <i>Viola-san</i> and <i>Cesario-san.</i> - That's right.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:20.070
- They're friends of these two. - So, what are you doing here?

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:23.070
We've been secretly escorting you at the Chief's request.

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:26.410
We'll mop up the rest of the meteorites with the Phoenice!

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:28.750
You hurry up and head for Sylvana!

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.420
We're grateful to you!

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:33.350
It's okay, it's okay. In exchange, it's your treat later, okay?

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:36.690
What, again?

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:40.890
Huh? Chinese? Italian will be better!

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:45.360
We just had Chinese, didn't we? It's decided, Italian!

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:47.520
I can't wait, I can't wait!

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:50.370
You guys are the same as ever, huh?

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:52.370
Mm-hmm! We always get along!

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.040
I get along with you, <i>Lumi-chan</i> and <i>Éc-chan,</i> too,

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.040
but not like I do with Cesario.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.710
She's a good enough person,

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:59.040
- but she never misses an opening. - Yeah, that's probably true.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:03.380
Somehow, I thought that the people in GOTT would be more...

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:06.050
You thought we'd be a more vigilant group, did you?

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:07.390
N- no!

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:11.880
There's all kinds of people! Both in GOTT and the rest of the world!

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:22.730
Well now, if a successor is not designated,

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:25.600
those of us on the committee are in charge of managing whatever happens

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:26.400
from here on.

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:29.640
Now that you mention it, I heard that the Orion's Arm managerial accounts

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:31.680
are in the black this term as well.

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:36.010
That's because my family has been left in charge of that area for generations.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:38.950
I can't help but have the executor take this opportunity

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:42.250
to place me in a position of slightly greater responsibility, can I?

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.020
Ta-da~a!

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:50.260
Sorry to keep you waiting! The heir to the Rosenfelt Financial Group has arrived!

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:00.710
What is this partition?

00:10:00.710 --> 00:10:02.370
It's a hygienic shield.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.640
Hygenic shield?

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:32.340
The analysis is complete. Timothy Constance.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:37.170
The correlation between Albert Rosenfelt and Marianne Constance's DNA makeup

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:39.900
has been confirmed.

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:43.910
This isn't going to be over and done with just like that, huh?

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:51.520
Yes, it appears that they made it in time.

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:54.690
I understand they're going to hold a party for him now.

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:59.360
Yes, I'm positive that <i>something</i> is going to happen.

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:01.420
I'll be expecting it.

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:21.720
What is it with this outfit? We can't eat any of the cuisine like this!

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:23.790
The Nouvlesse are pure-breedists,

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:28.060
who take pride in never having received any bioadaptive treatments.

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.900
The Rosenfelt family is among their associates.

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:34.400
We are to be treated at most like so many germs.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:40.400
Timothy... You'll have to live among these guys from now on, huh?

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:41.740
Horse racing?

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:42.740
Yes.

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:46.410
Horseback riding is for the ladies,

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:50.680
but speed races using machine horses are one of the interests we men have.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:53.420
There's not one of us who cannot do it.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:57.090
Machine horses are used in competitions that test one's courage and wisdom.

00:11:57.090 --> 00:12:00.760
We would, by all means, like to see the new chief's skills.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:03.760
B- but I've never ridden a machine horse...

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:06.760
Oh, how rude of us.

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:11.100
We had forgotten that you have not acquired the ways of the Nouvlesse culture.

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:13.970
As I hear it, your father, although being part of the family,

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:15.440
went to some frontier, pioneer planet...

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:18.780
...where he was taken in by a common young woman, or so it's said.

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:22.780
I would say that you cannot go against genetics...

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:26.780
If I win the race, I will have your recognition as the successor, right?

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:27.790
Of course.

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:29.820
However, if you lose,

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:33.310
we would like you to admit by yourself that you are unfit to be the successor.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.390
Surely, you wouldn't say no to that?

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:37.730
You've got it.

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.730
Somebody ready a machine horse for the chief!

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:43.400
There's no need for that.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:48.410
I'll loan you Donnerschlag. Give these guys the shock of their lives!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.740
B- but why?

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.740
Do you need a reason?

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:56.410
What do you think? It has turned out just as I said, hasn't it?

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.250
It certainly has.

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:09.930
I didn't think so many other participants would join in.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.760
What's more, those guys have veteran instructors supporting them.

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:14.430
That's all right!

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:17.420
After all, I'll be coming along with you!

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:19.530
R- right...

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:23.770
It looks like they're plotting something.

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:25.780
Make sure you're careful.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.400
Understood.

00:13:38.390 --> 00:13:41.060
That's the way! Increase our speed some more!

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:42.580
R- right!

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:47.060
That's pretty good, huh Chief?

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:49.400
But commoners should act like commoners!

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:52.490
You should have gone home before you got hurt!

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:55.740
They're thinking of doing something underhanded, all right!

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:57.740
Danger goes along with racing!

00:13:57.740 --> 00:14:00.080
We noblemen have a taste for it!

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:02.380
A commoner couldn't understand!

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:04.420
Are you scared?

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:06.510
Don't get thrown off, okay?

00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:16.820
That's the punishment you boys get for being so overly naughty!

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:20.100
Incredible, <i>Éclair-san!</i>

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:24.770
Thanks, Mister... or rather, um...

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:27.100
My friends call me Tim!

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:29.000
Okay, Tim!

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:35.510
Tim, something's coming!

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:39.050
Was that machine taking part?

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:41.220
It was mixed in with the other contestants.

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:43.690
That one is completely for military use. They're pros.

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:49.390
Tim, you take over Donner's piloting. I'm going to take them on!

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:50.360
Right!

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:54.400
You're ES members from the group administrative office, right?

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:59.070
Wasn't the meteor welcoming ceremony enough for you, fellow worker?

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:01.410
I heard that going around with your face uncovered

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:03.740
was the convention for ES members of GOTT,

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:05.410
but that is the height of foolishness!

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:10.750
It's always the bad guys that wear the masks! Tim, floor it!

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:11.740
Right!

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:16.010
You won't get away!

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:30.700
Donner, Wired Arm!

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.760
It's no use struggling!

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:43.910
That was good, Tim! You must have inherited your father's talents!

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:57.060
Are you okay, Tim?

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:58.620
You're all mine!

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.400
Titano!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:09.740
<i>Éc-chan!</i>

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:12.110
You guys are GOTT too!?

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:21.950
Too bad for you! Titano's armor is specially-made! Nyah!

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:27.090
Let him have it!

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:42.370
W- what is this?

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:43.610
When those two join hands,

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:47.380
they become able to control the bondings between molecules.

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:51.050
But it only works when they're hands are joined.

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:53.780
Thank you, Cesario, Viola!

00:16:55.720 --> 00:16:57.890
Our special assignment is finished!

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:00.580
All that's left now is to be treated to some Italian!

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:06.400
Cesario! Your hand! Your hand! Your hand!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:07.690
Ow!

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:11.400
All right, make it Chinese!

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:13.500
Make it Chinese, I said!

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:17.800
That was mean.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.920
Even if I did have a mother who came from a pioneer planet,

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:32.750
do you now see that I do have courage?

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:39.360
Indeed. It appears that your father's selection was the correct one.

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:42.060
I will hand over the letter of attorney to you.

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:46.970
As long as you all understand, that's good enough.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:56.050
Forgive me, <i>Éclair-san.</i> After all you did to help me...

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.380
That's okay.

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:01.050
I intended to do this from the start.

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:04.560
I just wanted to take back the good name of my mother,

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:08.060
after those guys treated her like she was some parasite.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:11.490
Are you sure you won't reconsider, Timothy?

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.730
Who are you?

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:18.290
I am Isaac Rosenfelt, your grandpa.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:21.070
Grandpa? He's your grandfather?

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:22.740
C- chairman!

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:25.740
We thought you were convalescing!

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:31.350
I am also the ringleader of those who stole your father away from your mother.

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:33.680
I won't say I was wrong for doing so.

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:37.690
The financial group needed Albert's strength.

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:41.360
Then, my dad didn't abandon us?

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:45.030
When I learned of Albert's will, I was at a loss.

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:48.930
I believed that I had to ascertain

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:52.040
whether you were worthy of inheriting the financial group.

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:55.570
T- then, the chief knew from the outset which planet it was

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:56.710
that had been designated?

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:58.380
That's right!

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:03.050
However, I did not think that these folks would be as rash as all this.

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:06.740
I will have to make sure to punish them sufficiently afterwards.

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:13.090
I get the feeling I know why my dad came back to this family by himself.

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:20.160
I think it's because my dad knew better than anyone else how terrible it would be

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:23.070
for a person raised normally to live among the Nouvlesse.

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:26.540
I'm sure that the reason my dad left me and my mom behind

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:28.740
was out of affection for us.

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:32.180
Even so, I'm sure the reason he chose me as his successor

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:37.550
was to give me the freedom to choose my own life.

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:44.020
However, Tim, you have the right to choose whatever life you want.

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:46.460
No matter what the stars may tell you,

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:49.760
you must choose your own path for yourself.

00:19:51.030 --> 00:19:56.030
I can't decide right now. However...

00:19:56.030 --> 00:20:00.700
if this family is such that it will fall apart if it doesn't have a head,

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:03.370
then I think that it would be better off if it does!

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:07.110
Mm-hmm. Until Timothy has made his determination,

00:20:07.110 --> 00:20:09.050
his right as successor will be reserved.

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:12.050
In the meantime, I will assist him as the head.

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:15.390
And, if by some chance anything happens to Timothy,

00:20:15.390 --> 00:20:18.620
the Rosenfelt Financial Group will immediately be broken up and dissolved.

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:20.060
Remember that!

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:24.830
You can take your time thinking this over, Tim.

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:28.070
Your life belongs to you, after all.

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:32.590
<i>Éclair-san... Éclair-san,</i> there's something about you that...

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:36.470
It's nothing!

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:48.690
You're watching, right? <i>Lumiere-san?</i>

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:53.210
Yes, and I'd like to have a clear explanation of this whole situation.

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:56.360
Evidentiary imaging!?

00:20:56.360 --> 00:21:00.060
Yes. Evidence that the group's administrative office

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:01.700
is interfering in our official business.

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:04.370
With this, we can hold them in check from now on.

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:06.170
In order to take these images,

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:09.370
you had Armbrust provoke the folks at the financial group, didn't you?

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:13.380
He told them to hold a race with the right of inheritance at stake!

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:17.970
With you there, I had faith that you would protect him.

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:22.720
That's all for today, we can disperse.

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:23.710
Right.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:31.520
Delicious, huh Cesario? Yeah? Yeah?

00:23:08.020 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>Too much power for a person to handle.</i>

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:15.030
<i>When flooded, the swirling power makes sport of them.</i>

00:23:15.030 --> 00:23:20.200
<i>Next time on Kiddy Grade</i>
